│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ exact_epigraph_polish                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ Add a final constrained epigraph solve for the exact objective.  After the smooth and     │
│                          │ contact-set stages have identified a strong contact graph, rescale its closest distance   │
│                          │ to one and minimize an explicit squared-diameter variable subject to every pairwise       │
│                          │ squared distance being at least one and no greater than that variable.  This directly     │
│                          │ solves the evaluator’s squared ratio objective locally, avoids soft-contact approximation │
│                          │ error, and retains the original candidate unless the returned configuration has a         │
│                          │ strictly better true score.                                                               │
