│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ exact_coherence_polish                                                                    │
│ patch_description        │ For the antipodal construction, the squared distance ratio is exactly `(1 - max_abs_dot)  │
│                          │ / 2`, so minimizing the maximum absolute inter-line dot product is the exact hard         │
│                          │ objective rather than merely a surrogate. Replace the final single-candidate selection    │
│                          │ with a reproducible batched hard-objective polishing phase over all ten retained          │
│                          │ candidates.                                                                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Each iteration constructs deterministic soft-contact descent proposals plus tangent-space │
│                          │ perturbations. Half of the perturbations affect all directions and half emphasize         │
│                          │ individual-line contact exchanges. A proposal is accepted only when its exact maximum     │
│                          │ absolute dot product improves, preserving the best hard ratio throughout and allowing the │
│                          │ search to escape the contact patterns favored by the late log-sum-exp stages.             │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0322                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
