│                          │ log-distance min/max surrogate, then elite descendants receive a sharper continuation.    │
│                          │ Finally, several leading candidates are rescaled to unit shortest squared distance and    │
│                          │ polished with SLSQP on the exact hard constraints `1 <= q_ij <= D`, minimizing            │
